## Context
DESIGN.md §4 PR-4 and PR-5, honoring R28 and R10. PR-4: pin the transformers
cache (env.cacheDir) under dataDir before constructing the pipeline — the
default lands weights outside dataDir, breaking uninstall-by-deleting-dataDir;
one line now versus gigabytes of surprise later. PR-5: the Gemini embedder key
travels in the URL query string (embeddings.ts) — move it to the header.
Cheapest custody wins.

## Exit criteria
- [x] PR-4: weights land under dataDir; uninstall test deletes everything (#27, merged verbatim 2026-08-29 as `5ae398a`, v1.10.0)
- [x] PR-5: key in header, no key in any logged/thrown URL (#28, merged verbatim 2026-08-29 as `b2b8598`, v1.10.0)
